---
import FooterComponent from "@/components/footer-component.astro";
import MainLayout from "@/layouts/main-layout.astro";

---

<MainLayout title="About VBC | Fresno Victory Baptist Church">
  <section class="bg-muted px-8 py-16 md:px-16 md:py-20 lg:px-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">
        About VBC
      </p>
      <h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold text-foreground md:text-5xl">Who We Are</h1>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        We are an independent Baptist church in south-east Fresno with a heart to
        reach our community and the world with the gospel of Jesus Christ. We are
        committed to sound Bible teaching and preaching so lives may be changed
        and enriched through Jesus Christ.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-background px-8 py-16 md:px-16 lg:px-24">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Exalt the Savior</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          We center every service on the Lord Jesus Christ and worship Him in
          spirit and in truth.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Edify the Saints</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          We teach and apply Scripture so believers grow stronger in faith,
          doctrine, and daily obedience.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Evangelize the Sinner</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          We gladly share the good news of salvation through Christ with Fresno and
          beyond.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-muted px-8 py-16 md:px-16 lg:px-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold text-foreground md:text-4xl">Our Beliefs</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">The Bible</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            We believe the Bible is the inerrant, inspired Word of God and our
            final authority for faith and practice.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">God</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            We believe God eternally exists as Father, Son, and Holy Spirit: three
            Persons, yet one God.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Jesus Christ</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            We believe Jesus Christ is the only begotten Son of God, true God and
            true man, born of a virgin and without sin.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">The Holy Spirit</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            We believe the Holy Spirit is God, equal with the Father and the Son,
            and active in the life of every believer.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Sin</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            We believe mankind fell through sin and now stands in need of
            redemption through Jesus Christ.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Sacrifice of Christ</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            We believe Christ died as our substitute, rose bodily from the dead,
            and ascended to Heaven.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Salvation</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            We believe salvation is God&apos;s gift of grace, received by personal
            faith in the Lord Jesus Christ.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">
            Eternal Security
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            We believe all who are truly saved are kept by God&apos;s power and are
            secure in Christ forever.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Service</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            We believe the local church exists for edification, exhortation, and
            evangelism according to Christ&apos;s command.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6">
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">The Last Days</h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            We believe in a literal interpretation of Scripture, Christ&apos;s return,
            and the coming fulfillment of God&apos;s prophetic plan.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-background px-8 py-16 md:px-16 lg:px-24">
    <div
      class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-10 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-8 md:grid-cols-2"
    >
      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-foreground">Service Times</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-muted-foreground">
          <li><strong class="text-foreground">Sunday:</strong> 10:00 AM, 11:00 AM, 6:00 PM</li>
          <li><strong class="text-foreground">Thursday:</strong> 7:00 PM</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-foreground">Visit Us</h2>
        <p class="mb-3 text-muted-foreground">
          1717 N Gateway Blvd #105<br />Fresno, CA 93727
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://goo.gl/maps/Tf3fDh44gbomRUrT9"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="font-medium text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline"
        >
          Get Directions
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FooterComponent />
</MainLayout>
